text:
#COVID19 has exposed the global burden of #mentalhealth conditions & highlighted the need for concerted action to prevent & treat them. 
@WHO
supports 
@FIFAcom
's #ReachOut campaign to increase mental health awareness & to encourage those who are struggling to seek help.
